@startuml

autonumber
hide footbox

title Add Publication to Collection Of Publication

actor "User" as User
participant ":System" as System

User -> System : I want to add a publication to one of my collections
activate System

System --> User : Here's your collections, select one

User -> System : Selected collection

System --> User :  Here's your publications, select one

User -> System : Selected publication

System --> User : Publication added to the collection
deactivate System

@enduml
